d org-mode file digging into one subject — a question&#xA;to answer, or a topic to explore.&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;how&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;the title summarizes that subject, and a heading states it in full when the&#xA;title cannot.&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;who&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;the agent that writes is the writer, the agent that audits is the auditor, and&#xA;the human is the user.&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;dt&gt;rule&lt;/dt&gt;&#xA;&lt;dd&gt;the user talks informally, and the writer lands what they mean in the note&amp;rsquo;s&#xA;own words and form.&lt;/dd&gt;&#xA;&lt;/dl&gt;</description>
